# What an agent asks the user (ACP elicitation): a form of Claude Code's
# AskUserQuestion shape, picked with numbers and j/k, typed into, and
# submitted; a link to open; and a plan to approve. The fake agent's
# messages choose what it does: see crates/daemon/examples/fake_agent.rs.
size 1100x900
keys <C-;>:Agent claude<CR>
keys i
type elicit
keys <CR>
wait-for Please answer the following questions.
sleep 700
shot elicit-form
keys 2
keys j
keys hello
keys <CR>
keys x
keys jj
keys <Tab>
keys <BS>
type 7
sleep 300
shot elicit-filled
keys <Down><Down>
keys <CR>
wait-for answered:
sleep 300
shot elicit-answered
type elicit-url
keys <CR>
wait-for Authenticate with MCP server linear
sleep 700
shot elicit-url
keys <Down><CR>
wait-for answered:
type approve-plan
keys <CR>
wait-for Write the failing test
sleep 700
shot elicit-plan
size 480x700
shot elicit-plan-narrow
